lly Rare 2018 Aston Martin Vanquish Zagato Now Available at Prestige Imports**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Prestige Imports is honored to present one of the automotive world's most exclusive masterpieces: a 2018 Aston Martin Vanquish Zagato. With merely 2,774 miles on the odometer, this virtually untouched example represents the pinnacle of British craftsmanship merged with Italian design excellence.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**A Legacy of Exclusivity**<br\\\/><br\\\/>The Vanquish Zagato nameplate represents a storied collaboration between Aston Martin and the legendary Italian design house Zagato, dating back to 1960. This 2018 iteration continues that prestigious heritage with breathtaking coachwork that transforms the already stunning Vanquish into something truly extraordinary. With global production strictly limited, encountering one of these automotive sculptures is a privilege reserved for the most discerning collectors.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Commanding Performance**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Beneath the sculpted bonnet resides a magnificent 5.9-liter V12 engine, delivering a symphony of power that only a naturally-aspirated twelve-cylinder can provide. This hand-assembled masterpiece produces exhilarating performance while maintaining the refined character expected of an Aston Martin grand tourer. The gasoline-fed powerplant propels this British exotic with authority, making every journey an unforgettable experience.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Bespoke Design Elements**<br\\\/><br\\\/>The Vanquish Zagato distinguishes itself through distinctive design cues including the signature double-bubble roof, unique front grille treatment, and exquisite carbon fiber bodywork. Every surface has been meticulously crafted to blend aerodynamic efficiency with timeless elegance. The result is a vehicle that commands attention whether stationary or in motion.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Investment-Grade Collectibility**<br\\\/><br\\\/>With under 3,000 miles, this Vanquish Zagato remains in virtually as-delivered condition, representing an exceptional opportunity for collectors seeking museum-quality examples. The limited production numbers ensure this model's place in automotive history, making it not just a driving experience but a tangible investment in automotive art.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Available Now**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Stock Number: ATJ33882<br\\\/>VIN: SCFLMCPZ8JGJ33882<br\\\/><br\\\/>Contact Prestige Imports today to arrange a private viewing of this extraordinary Aston Martin Vanquish Zagato. This is your opportunity to own one of the rarest and most desirable modern Aston Martins ever created. Sales Price includes dealer fee of $1447.50 and $299 electronic filing fee. Tax, tag, title and registrations fees are not included and are calculated at time of purchase.\",\"isOEMCertified\":0,\"isDealerCertified\":0,\"body\":\"Coupe\",\"standardBody\":null,\"bodyStyle\":\"Coupe\",\"epaHighway\":null,\"epaCity\":null,\"drivetrain\":\"Rear Wheel Drive\",\"hasWarranty\":0,\"isSold\":0,\"dealerId\":7006,\"dealerCity\":\"North Miami Beach\",\"dealerState\":\"FL\",\"location\":\"North Miami Beach, FL\",\"dealerName\":\"Lamborghini Miami\",\"seoUrl\":\"vehicle-details\\\/used-2018-aston-martin-vanquish-zagato-coupe-north-miami-beach-fl-id-65380394\",\"mainImageUrl\":\"\\\/\\\/cdn-ds.com\\\/stock\\\/2018-Aston-Martin-Vanquish-Zagato-Coupe-North-Miami-Beach-FL\\\/seo\\\/ICC80512-SCFLMCPZ8JGJ33882\\\/sz_123556\\\/a1b89c945a989ff92ffb5511cabd54c6.jpg\",\"photoCount\":60,\"series\":\"\",\"xSeries\":\"\",\"seriesCode\":\"\",\"cab\":\"\",\"bed\":\"\",\"videoCount\":0,\"comment1\":\"\",\"comment2\":\"\",\"comment3\":\"\",\"comment4\":\"\",\"comment5\":\"\",\"otherInfo\":{\"isVinDecodeEnabled\":true},\"dealerComment\":\"\",\"videos\":[],\"images\":{},\"viewCount\":0,\"carfaxReport\":{\"image\":\"https:\\\/\\\/partnerstatic.carfax.com\\\/img\\\/valuebadge\\\/showme.svg\",\"link\":\"https:\\\/\\\/www.carfax.com\\\/vehiclehistory\\\/ar20\\\/rHBms6TWKkzDK4Mvi7LEbrx0cWZ1BjYalrR_lOpkJc7-9vHrv6YftcuSJrC2j9GyD64o5A4I89zob0f