null,\"interiorColorIcon\":null,\"upholstery\":\"\",\"interiorColorGeneric\":null,\"exteriorColor\":\"SILVER\",\"exteriorColorCode\":\"\",\"exteriorColorHex\":null,\"exteriorColorIcon\":null,\"exteriorColorGeneric\":null,\"fuelType\":\"\",\"wheelbaseCode\":\"\",\"vehicleId\":147974803,\"isSpecial\":0,\"specialDisclaimer\":\"\",\"daysInStock\":6,\"dateInStock\":{\"date\":\"2026-09-24 00:00:00.000000\",\"timezone_type\":3,\"timezone\":\"UTC\"},\"description\":\"\\\"**2007 Aston Martin Vantage &ndash; Pure British Performance Meets Timeless Elegance**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Prestige Imports is proud to present this exceptional 2007 Aston Martin Vantage, a stunning example of British automotive artistry that continues to captivate enthusiasts worldwide. With just 37,640 miles on the odometer, this hand-built masterpiece represents an incredible opportunity to own an icon of performance and luxury.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Performance That Thrills**<br\\\/><br\\\/>At the heart of this Vantage lies a magnificent 4.3-liter DOHC MPFI 32-valve V8 engine, delivering an intoxicating symphony of power and precision. Paired with a pure-driving enthusiast's dream &ndash; a 6-speed manual transmission with overdrive &ndash; this Aston Martin offers an engaging, connected driving experience that's increasingly rare in today's automotive landscape. The limited slip differential, dynamic stability control, and traction control work in harmony to deliver confidence-inspiring performance, while the rear-wheel-drive configuration ensures authentic sports car dynamics.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Engineering Excellence**<br\\\/><br\\\/>The sophisticated 4-wheel double wishbone independent suspension with coil springs and front\\\/rear anti-roll bars provides exceptional handling prowess, whether carving through canyon roads or cruising the boulevard. Power rack-and-pinion steering delivers precise feedback, while powerful 4-wheel ventilated disc brakes with ABS, electronic brakeforce distribution, and brake assist provide commanding stopping power. The staggered performance tire setup &ndash; P235\\\/45ZR18 front and P275\\\/40ZR18 rear &ndash; mounted on stunning 10-spoke alloy wheels (18\\\"\\\" x 8.5\\\"\\\" front, 18\\\"\\\" x 9.5\\\"\\\" rear) completes the performance package.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Luxurious Interior Appointments**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Step inside to discover a cabin wrapped in full-grain leather seat trim, featuring power sport bucket seats with dual lumbar adjustment for optimal comfort during spirited drives. The Alcantara headlining and anthracite interior fittings create an atmosphere of refined sophistication, while the leather-wrapped shift knob connects you directly to the driving experience. Modern conveniences include automatic climate control, power windows and locks, a 160W Aston Martin AM\\\/FM stereo with 6-disc in-dash CD changer, trip computer, and tire pressure monitoring system.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Safety and Security**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Your investment is protected by an anti-theft alarm system with immobilizer, while comprehensive safety features include dual-stage front airbags with occupant classification sensors, head and thorax side impact airbags, and side impact door beams. Parking assist reversing sensors add convenience to daily driving.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Stock #10920A \\\/ VIN: SCFBB03B37GC03292**<br\\\/><br\\\/>This is your opportunity to own an automotive legend. Contact Prestige Imports today to experience this remarkable Aston Martin Vantage. Sales Price includes dealer fee of $1447.50 and $299 electronic filing fee. Tax, tag, title and registrations fees are not included and are calculated at time of purchase.\\\"\",\"isOEMCertified\":0,\"isDealerCertified\":0,\"body\":\"\",\"standardBody\":null,\"bodyStyle\":\"\",\"epaHighway\":19,\"epaCity\":13,\"drivetrain\":\"Rear Wheel Drive\",\"hasWarranty\":0,\"isSold\":0,\"dealerId\":7006,\"dealerCity\":\"North Miami Beach\",\"dealerState\":\"FL\",\"location\":\"North Miami Beach, FL\",\"dealerN