r performance, the M5 enters a new era with electrified power while remaining true to BMW M's legendary driving dynamics. Powered by a twin-turbocharged 4.4L M TwinPower Turbo V8 paired with a plug-in hybrid electric motor, the M5 produces a staggering 717 horsepower and 738 lb-ft of torque, launching from 0&ndash;60 mph in approximately 3.4 seconds through BMW's intelligent M xDrive all-wheel-drive system. Finished in the eye-catching BMW Individual Miami Blue, this M5 commands attention with its sculpted widebody design, illuminated kidney grille, aggressive aerodynamic styling, and unmistakable presence whether arriving at an exclusive automotive event or carving through your favorite back road. Inside, the luxurious cockpit features premium Merino leather, illuminated M multifunction seats, a curved BMW display with Operating System 8.5, and meticulously crafted performance-focused details that perfectly balance cutting-edge technology with everyday comfort. As one of BMW's most powerful production sedans ever built and enhanced by the exclusivity of its Individual paint finish, this 2026 M5 offers an exceptional opportunity for enthusiasts seeking uncompromising performance with unmistakable style. <br\\\/><br\\\/>This vehicle features a number of premium upgrades and enhancements, including:<br\\\/>&bull; Full PPF & Ceramic Coating<br\\\/>&bull; Eventuri Intakes<br\\\/>&bull; Akrapovic Titanium Exhaust<br\\\/>&bull; And much more<br\\\/><br\\\/>Contact Prestige Imports to make this BMW M5 yours today. Sales Price includes dealer fee of $1447.50 and $299 electronic filing fee. Tax, tag, title and registrations fees are not included and are calculated at time of purchase.\",\"isOEMCertified\":0,\"isDealerCertified\":0,\"body\":\"\",\"standardBody\":null,\"bodyStyle\":\"\",\"epaHighway\":null,\"epaCity\":null,\"drivetrain\":\"All Wheel Drive\",\"hasWarranty\":0,\"isSold\":0,\"dealerId\":7006,\"dealerCity\":\"North Miami Beach\",\"dealerState\":\"FL\",\"location\"