own a nearly-new 2024 BMW M8 Competition, finished in the stunning Brooklyn Grey Metallic. With just 11,393 miles, this ultimate driving machine delivers supercar performance wrapped in sophisticated German engineering.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Powerhouse Performance**<br\\\/><br\\\/>At the heart of this beast lies a hand-built 4.4-liter twin-turbocharged V8 engine, unleashing breathtaking acceleration through an 8-speed sport automatic transmission with STEPTRONIC sequential shift control. The xDrive all-wheel-drive system with electronic transfer case ensures power is delivered precisely where needed, while the electro-mechanical limited-slip differential maximizes grip through every corner. Adaptive suspension with driver-selectable modes transforms this M8 from a refined grand tourer to a track-ready weapon at the touch of a button.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Exquisite Interior Appointments**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Step inside to discover a cabin wrapped in luxurious Extended Merino Leather in Black, offering unparalleled comfort and sophistication. The M Sport seats feature 14-way power adjustment with heating and ventilation, ensuring perfect positioning for spirited drives or long-distance cruising. The heated M Sport steering wheel puts control at your fingertips, while the Head-Up Display keeps critical information in your line of sight.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Technology & Convenience**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Stay connected with Apple CarPlay and Android Auto compatibility, wireless charging, and the Live Cockpit Pro navigation system. The Harman\\\/Kardon surround sound system with 16 speakers delivers concert-hall acoustics. Advanced safety features include the Driving Assistance Package and the Driving Assistance Professional Package, which provide frontal collision warning, lane departure warning, and comprehensive driver monitoring.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Distinctive Style**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Rolling on aggressive 20-inch M Star-Spoke wheels, this M8 commands attention with its muscular stance, dual 