turbocharged 4.4L V8 produces an impressive 617 horsepower and 553 lb-ft of torque, sending power through an 8-speed automatic transmission and BMW's intelligent all-wheel-drive system. The M8 Competition Convertible can accelerate from 0&ndash;60 mph in approximately 3.0 seconds, delivering supercar-caliber acceleration while maintaining the refinement expected from a luxury grand tourer. Its muscular proportions, sculpted bodywork, signature kidney grille, quad exhaust outlets, and retractable soft top create a striking presence whether cruising along the coast or carving through winding roads. Inside, the cabin combines premium materials, Full Merino Leather, advanced BMW technology, and supportive M Sport seating to create an environment that is equally suited to relaxed grand touring and spirited driving. Finished in Brooklyn Grey Metallic over a Sakhir Orange and Black interior, this particular M8 Competition Convertible offers an especially distinctive combination of understated exterior elegance and vibrant interior character. For enthusiasts seeking the performance of an M car with the luxury of a grand tourer and the freedom of open-air driving, the 2023 BMW M8 Competition Convertible is an exceptional choice. <br\\\/><br\\\/>Contact Prestige Imports to make this BMW M8 Competition Convertible yours today. Sales Price includes dealer fee of $1447.50 and $299 electronic filing fee. Tax, tag, title and registrations fees are not included and are calculated at time of purchase.\",\"isOEMCertified\":0,\"isDealerCertified\":0,\"body\":\"\",\"standardBody\":null,\"bodyStyle\":\"\",\"epaHighway\":22,\"epaCity\":15,\"drivetrain\":\"All Wheel Drive\",\"hasWarranty\":0,\"isSold\":0,\"dealerId\":7006,\"dealerCity\":\"North Miami Beach\",\"dealerState\":\"FL\",\"location\":\"North Miami Beach, FL\",\"dealerName\":\"Lamborghini Miami\",\"seoUrl\":\"vehicle-details\\\/used-2023-bmw-m8-competition-convertible-north-miami-beach-fl-id-65945294\",\"mainImageUrl\":\"\\\/\\\/