 2025 Chevrolet Corvette Z06 3LZ Convertible for sale! <br\\\/><br\\\/>Combining exotic-car performance with the freedom of open-air driving, the Z06 represents one of the most thrilling Corvettes ever created and showcases the incredible capabilities of Chevrolet's mid-engine platform. At its heart is a naturally aspirated 5.5L LT6 flat-plane-crank V8 producing an astonishing 670 horsepower and 460 lb-ft of torque, revving to an incredible 8,600 rpm and paired with an 8-speed dual-clutch transmission for lightning-fast shifts. The Z06's widebody proportions, functional aerodynamic design, center-exit exhaust, and staggered 20-inch front and 21-inch rear wheels give it an unmistakable presence, while the retractable hardtop allows the driver to experience the full sound and character of the high-revving V8 with the push of a button. The premium 3LZ cabin elevates the experience with upscale materials, advanced technology, and a driver-focused environment designed to complement the Corvette's extraordinary performance. For enthusiasts seeking supercar-level acceleration, razor-sharp handling, and the unmistakable sound of a naturally aspirated flat-plane V8, the Z06 Convertible delivers an experience few cars can match. <br\\\/><br\\\/>Contact Prestige Imports to make this Chevrolet Corvette Z06 3LZ Convertible yours today. Sales Price includes dealer fee of $1447.50 and $299 electronic filing fee. Tax, tag, title and registrations fees are not included and are calculated at time of purchase.\",\"isOEMCertified\":0,\"isDealerCertified\":0,\"body\":\"\",\"standardBody\":null,\"bodyStyle\":\"\",\"epaHighway\":20,\"epaCity\":12,\"drivetrain\":\"Rear Wheel Drive\",\"hasWarranty\":0,\"isSold\":0,\"dealerId\":7006,\"dealerCity\":\"North Miami Beach\",\"dealerState\":\"FL\",\"location\":\"North Miami Beach, FL\",\"dealerName\":\"Lamborghini Miami\",\"seoUrl\":\"vehicle-details\\\/used-2025-chevrolet-corvette-z06-convertible-w\\\/3lz-north-miami-beach-fl-id-65896958\",\"main