rice3\":0,\"NADARetailPrice\":0,\"mileage\":19725,\"transmission\":\"automatic\",\"transmissionDescription\":\"\",\"transmissionSpeedNumber\":\"\",\"engineCylindersNumber\":\"8\",\"engineDisplacement\":\"4.5\",\"engineDescription\":\"\",\"engineAspirationType\":\"\",\"engineBlockType\":\"\",\"interiorColor\":\"\",\"interiorColorCode\":\"\",\"interiorColorHex\":null,\"interiorColorIcon\":null,\"upholstery\":\"\",\"interiorColorGeneric\":null,\"exteriorColor\":\"Nero\",\"exteriorColorCode\":\"252627\",\"exteriorColorHex\":null,\"exteriorColorIcon\":null,\"exteriorColorGeneric\":null,\"fuelType\":\"\",\"wheelbaseCode\":\"\",\"vehicleId\":147246253,\"isSpecial\":0,\"specialDisclaimer\":\"\",\"daysInStock\":61,\"dateInStock\":{\"date\":\"2026-07-31 00:00:00.000000\",\"timezone_type\":3,\"timezone\":\"UTC\"},\"description\":\"\\\"**2012 Ferrari 458 Italia - The Prancing Horse Awaits**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Prestige Imports is thrilled to present this exceptional 2012 Ferrari 458 Italia Coupe, a masterpiece of Italian engineering that represents one of the most celebrated supercars of its generation. With only 19,500 miles on the odometer, this meticulously maintained example is ready to deliver the exhilarating performance and timeless style that only a Ferrari can provide.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Stunning Nero Elegance**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Finished in classic Nero black, this 458 Italia commands attention with its aggressive yet elegant lines. The sinister dark exterior is perfectly complemented by striking 20\\\"\\\" Shadow Chrome Alloy Wheels that add a contemporary edge to Ferrari's iconic design language. The body-colored bumpers, rear lip spoiler, and bi-xenon HID auto-leveling headlamps with washers create a purposeful stance that hints at the performance lurking beneath.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Heart-Pounding Performance**<br\\\/><br\\\/>At the core of this Italian stallion lies a naturally-aspirated 4.5L DOHC 32-valve V8 engine, producing a symphony of sound that enthusiasts dream about. Paired with Ferrari's lightning-fast 7-speed dual-clutch automatic transmission with manual override, this masterpiece delivers power to the rear wheels through a limited-slip differential. The sophisticated front and rear independent active, adjustable self-leveling suspension with magnetic fluid-filled shocks ensures razor-sharp handling, while Brembo 4-wheel vented disc brakes provide stopping power worthy of the performance.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Bespoke Interior Appointments**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Step inside to discover a driver-focused cockpit featuring a luxurious Leather and Alcantara Two-Color Interior that exemplifies Italian craftsmanship. The Custom Steering Wheel Color and distinctive Tachometer in White create a personalized racing atmosphere, while Interior Grilles in Leather add refined touches throughout. Front leather-trimmed bucket seats with 4-way adjustments keep you planted during spirited driving, complemented by aluminum accents and a leather dashboard.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Technology & Convenience**<br\\\/><br\\\/>This 458 Italia comes equipped with dual-zone automatic climate control, AM\\\/FM stereo with 6-disc changer, auxiliary audio input, iPod integration, and Bluetooth connectivity. Remote keyless entry, power windows, and a comprehensive security system with engine immobilizer provide modern convenience.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Verified Provenance**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Both CARFAX and AUTOCHECK reports confirm clean histories, providing peace of mind with your investment.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Stock #10883D \\\/ VIN: ZFF67NFA6C0183171**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Don't miss this opportunity to own an automotive icon. Contact Prestige Imports today to experience the 458 Italia difference. Sales Price includes dealer fee of $1447.50 and $299 electronic filing fee. Tax, tag, title and registrations fees are not included and are calculated at time of purchase.\\\"\",\"isOEMCertified\":0,\"isDealerCertified\":0,\"body\":\"\",\"standardBody\":null,\"bodyStyle\":\"\",\"epaHighway\"