and 560 lb-ft of torque, the 488 GTB accelerates from 0&ndash;60 mph in around 3.0 seconds and reaches a top speed of approximately 205 mph. Its sculpted aerodynamic bodywork, dramatic side air intakes, aggressive stance, and mid-engine proportions create an unmistakable presence whether carving through winding roads, arriving at an exclusive automotive gathering, or taking center stage in a collection. Inside, the driver-focused cockpit blends handcrafted Italian craftsmanship with carbon fiber accents, advanced technology, and Ferrari's signature steering-wheel-mounted controls, creating an environment designed to keep the driver connected to every mile. With a seven-speed dual-clutch transmission, rear-wheel drive, adaptive suspension, and Ferrari's advanced electronic driving systems, the 488 GTB delivers the kind of precision and performance that makes every drive feel like an event. <br\\\/><br\\\/>Contact Prestige Imports to make this Ferrari 488 GTB yours today. Sales Price includes dealer fee of $1447.50 and $299 electronic filing fee. Tax, tag, title and registrations fees are not included and are calculated at time of purchase.\",\"isOEMCertified\":0,\"isDealerCertified\":0,\"body\":\"Coupe\",\"standardBody\":null,\"bodyStyle\":\"Coupe\",\"epaHighway\":22,\"epaCity\":15,\"drivetrain\":\"Rear Wheel Drive\",\"hasWarranty\":0,\"isSold\":0,\"dealerId\":7006,\"dealerCity\":\"North Miami Beach\",\"dealerState\":\"FL\",\"location\":\"North Miami Beach, FL\",\"dealerName\":\"Lamborghini Miami\",\"seoUrl\":\"vehicle-details\\\/used-2018-ferrari-488-gtb-north-miami-beach-fl-id-65800516\",\"mainImageUrl\":\"\\\/\\\/cdn-ds.com\\\/stock\\\/2018-Ferrari-488-GTB-North-Miami-Beach-FL\\\/seo\\\/ICC80512-ZFF79ALA6J0232412\\\/sz_102797\\\/56f7674fd71e91f53381f939fa02b34e.jpg\",\"photoCount\":47,\"series\":\"\",\"xSeries\":\"\",\"seriesCode\":\"\",\"cab\":\"\",\"bed\":\"\",\"videoCount\":0,\"comment1\":\"Apple CarPlay,Automatic Emergency Braking,Brake Assist,Dual Climate Con