on car with a turbocharged V8 in the modern era, the 488 GTB combines extraordinary performance with the refinement and usability expected from a modern Ferrari grand tourer. <br\\\/><br\\\/>Contact Prestige Imports to make this Ferrari 488 GTB yours today. Sales Price includes dealer fee of $1447.50 and $299 electronic filing fee. Tax, tag, title and registrations fees are not included and are calculated at time of purchase.\",\"isOEMCertified\":0,\"isDealerCertified\":0,\"body\":\"\",\"standardBody\":null,\"bodyStyle\":\"\",\"epaHighway\":22,\"epaCity\":15,\"drivetrain\":\"Rear Wheel Drive\",\"hasWarranty\":0,\"isSold\":0,\"dealerId\":7006,\"dealerCity\":\"North Miami Beach\",\"dealerState\":\"FL\",\"location\":\"North Miami Beach, FL\",\"dealerName\":\"Lamborghini Miami\",\"seoUrl\":\"vehicle-details\\\/used-2016-ferrari-488-gtb-north-miami-beach-fl-id-66092573\",\"mainImageUrl\":\"\\\/\\\/cdn-ds.com\\\/stock\\\/2016-Ferrari-488-GTB-North-Miami-Beach-FL\\\/seo\\\/ICC80512-ZFF79ALA2G0214997\\\/sz_100191\\\/b314ea2eec371cf50005e03d9ec077fb.jpg\",\"photoCount\":53,\"series\":\"\",\"xSeries\":\"\",\"seriesCode\":\"\",\"cab\":\"\",\"bed\":\"\",\"videoCount\":0,\"comment1\":\"Backup Camera,Brake Assist,Keyless Entry,Keyless Start,Leather Seats,Limited Slip Center Differential,Rear Spoiler,Stability Control,Traction Control,Turbocharged,USB Port\",\"comment2\":\"\",\"comment3\":\"\",\"comment4\":\"\",\"comment5\":\"\",\"otherInfo\":{\"isVinDecodeEnabled\":true},\"dealerComment\":\"\",\"videos\":[],\"images\":{},\"viewCount\":0,\"carfaxReport\":{\"image\":\"https:\\\/\\\/partnerstatic.carfax.com\\\/img\\\/valuebadge\\\/fair.svg\",\"link\":\"https:\\\/\\\/www.carfax.com\\\/vehiclehistory\\\/ar20\\\/XF7G1uMz8EFMP7zPd7BR1eEri6vYcMCuFaNb7aw081FBtK4gYhZvTPagEzJlM5RUaS1b01DLuVu3-FJb83W49XbfncgA-nO9ZYc\",\"isOneOwner\":false},\"isInTransit\":0,\"certifiedInspectionUrl\":null,\"standardizedExteriorColor\":\"Gray\",\"standardizedBody\":\"Unspecified\\\/Other\",\"standardizedDrivetrain\":\"Rear-Wheel Drive\",\"standardizedEngineDisplacement\":\"3.9\",\"standardizedEngineCylinders\":\"8 Cylinder\",\"standardizedTransmission\":\"Automatic\",\"standardizedFuelType\":\"Unspecified\\\/Other\",\"standardizedInteriorColor\":\"Black\",\"standardizedInteriorUpholstery\":\"Unspecified\\\/Other\",\"upperLevelPackageCode\":null,\"packagesAndAccessories\":[],\"certificationProgram\":\"\",\"title\":\"2016 Ferrari 488 GTB\",\"status\":\"in stock\",\"rebateAmount\":0,\"isReserved\":0,\"isCourtesy\":0,\"statusCode\":null,\"disclaimers\":[],\"isPooled\":0,\"cpo_validated\":null,\"vdp\":\"https:\\\/\\\/www.lamborghinimiami.com\\\/vehicle-details\\\/used-2016-ferrari-488-gtb-north-miami-beach-fl-id-66092573\",\"srp\":\"https:\\\/\\\/www.lamborghinimiami.com\\\/used-2016-ferrari-488-miami-fl\"}); });<\/script>\n<script>window.inlineJS.push(function() { Moff.modules.get('DataLayer').pushData('VehicleObject_65736419', {\"vuid\":65736419,\"stockNumber\":\"86200X\",\"year\":2019,\"isNew\":false,\"finalPrice\":471697,\"make\":\"Ferrari\",\"model\":\"488\",\"modelNumber\":\"\",\"modelCode\":32757,\"trim\":\"Spider\",\"styleDescription\":\"\",\"styleId\":409122,\"doorsNumber\":\"2\",\"vin\":\"ZFF80AMAXK0238468\",\"MSRP\":0,\"invoiceAmount\":0,\"blueBook\":0,\"sellingPrice\":469950,\"internetPrice\":0,\"originalPrice\":469950,\"miscPrice1\":0,\"miscPrice2\":0,\"miscPrice3\":0,\"NADARetailPrice\":0,\"mileage\":6445,\"transmission\":\"automatic\",\"transmissionDescription\":\"\",\"transmissionSpeedNumber\":\"\",\"engineCylindersNumber\":\"8\",\"engineDisplacement\":\"3.9\",\"engineDescription\":\"\",\"engineAspirationType\":\"\",\"engineBlockType\":\"\",\"interiorColor\":\"Beige Tradizione\",\"interiorColorCode\":\"\",\"interiorColorHex\":null,\"interiorColorIcon\":null,\"upholstery\":\"\",\"interiorColorGeneric\":null,\"exteriorColor\":\"Rosso Corsa Metalizzato\",\"exteriorColorCode\":\"E32F43\",\"exteriorColorHex\":null,\"exteriorColorIcon\":null,\"exteriorColorGeneric\":null,\"fuelType\":\"\",\"wheelbaseCode\":\"\",\"vehicleId\":147123501,\"isSpecial\":0,\"specialDisclaimer\":\"\",\"daysInStock\":62,\"dateInStock\":{\"date\":\"2026-07-30 00:00:00.000000\",\"timezone_type\":3,\"timezone\":\"UTC\"},\"description\":\"**2019 Ferrari 488 Spider &ndash; Italian Supercar Excellence Awaits**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Prestige Imports is thrilled to present this breathtaking 2019 Ferrari 488 Spider, a masterpiece of Italian engineering that combines raw performance with open-air exhilaration. With only 6,445 miles on the odometer, this meticulously maintained convertible represents an exceptional opportunity to own one of the world's most coveted supercars.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Iconic Design & Color Combination**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Finished in the legendary **Rosso Corsa Metalizzato**, this 488 Spider wears Ferrari's most iconic shade &ndash; a deep, lustrous red that commands attention wherever it goes. The stunning exterior is perfectly complemented by a sophisticated **Beige Tradizione leather interior**, creating an elegant contrast that exudes both sportiness and refinement. This classic Ferrari color pairing is timeless and unmistakably Italian.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Heart-Pounding Performance**<br\\\/><br\\\/>At the core of this Spider lies a twin-turbocharged **3.9-liter V8 engine** producing an astounding 661 horsepower, paired with Ferrari's lightning-fast **7-speed F1-Superfast dual-clutch transmission**. The rear-wheel-drive configuration, combined with an electro-mechanical limited-slip differential and F1-Trac traction control, delivers an intoxicating driving experience that's both thrilling and confidence-inspiring. Ceramic disc brakes provide fade-free stopping power worthy of this supercar's capabilities.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Convertible Freedom**<br\\\/><br\\\/>The power-retractable hardtop transforms this Ferrari from coupe to convertible in just 14 seconds, allowing you to experience the intoxicating symphony of that twin-turbo V8 in all its glory. The glass rear window and integrated wind blocker ensure comfort even at speed.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Premium Features & Technology**<br\\\/><br\\\/>This 488 Spider comes equipped with 20-inch forged matte grey wheels, adaptive magnetic suspension, harman\\\/kardon audio system, integrated navigation, backup camera, and luxurious leather sport bucket seats. The driver-selectable modes allow you to tailor the driving experience from comfortable grand touring to track-ready aggression.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Verified History**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Both CARFAX and AutoCheck reports confirm this Ferrari's clean history, providing complete peace of mind.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Stock #86200X \\\/ VIN: ZFF80AMAXK0238468**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Don't miss this rare opportunity to own an exceptional 488 Spider. Contact Prestige Imports today to schedule your exclusive viewing. Sales Price includes dealer fee of $1447.50 and $299 electronic filing fee. Tax, tag, title and registrations fees are not included and are calculated at time of purchase.\",\"isOEMCertified\":0,\"isDealerCertified\":0,\"body\":\"\",\"standardBody\":null,\"bodyStyle\":\"\",\"epaHighway\":22,\"epaCity\":15,\"drivetrain\":\"Rear Wheel Drive\",\"hasWarranty\":0,\"isSold\":0,\"dealerId\":7006,\"dealerCity\":\"North Miami Beach\",\"dealerState\":\"FL\",\"location\":\"North Miami Beach, FL\",\"dealerName\":\"Lamborghini Miami\",\"seoUrl\":\"vehicle-details\\\/used-2019-ferrari-488-spider-north-miami-beach-fl-id-65736419\",\"mainImageUrl\":null,\"photoCount\":0,\"series\":\"\",\"xSeries\":\"\",\"seriesCode\":\"\",\"cab\":\"\",\"bed\":\"\",\"videoCount\":0,\"comment1\":\"Backup Camera,Brake Assist,Convertible,Keyless Entry,Keyless Start,Leather Seats,Limited Slip Center Differential,Navigation System,Rear Spoiler,Stability Control,Traction Control,Turbocharged\",\"comment2\":\"\",\"comment3\":\"\",\"comment4\":\"\",\"comment5\":\"\",\"otherInfo\":{\"isVinDecodeEnabled\":true},\"dealerComment\":\"\",\"videos\":[],\"images\":{},\"viewCou