htaking performance, and the unmistakable emotion of twelve cylinders. <br\\\/><br\\\/>Contact Prestige Imports to make this Ferrari 812 GTS yours today. Sales Price includes dealer fee of $1447.50 and $299 electronic filing fee. Tax, tag, title and registrations fees are not included and are calculated at time of purchase.\",\"isOEMCertified\":0,\"isDealerCertified\":0,\"body\":\"\",\"standardBody\":null,\"bodyStyle\":\"\",\"epaHighway\":15,\"epaCity\":12,\"drivetrain\":\"Rear Wheel Drive\",\"hasWarranty\":0,\"isSold\":0,\"dealerId\":7006,\"dealerCity\":\"North Miami Beach\",\"dealerState\":\"FL\",\"location\":\"North Miami Beach, FL\",\"dealerName\":\"Lamborghini Miami\",\"seoUrl\":\"vehicle-details\\\/used-2022-ferrari-812-gts-north-miami-beach-fl-id-65531970\",\"mainImageUrl\":\"\\\/\\\/cdn-ds.com\\\/stock\\\/2022-Ferrari-812-GTS-North-Miami-Beach-FL\\\/seo\\\/ICC80512-ZFF97CMA6N0279227\\\/sz_108049\\\/83e743094759ce9fbedcc484a2259415.jpg\",\"photoCount\":56,\"series\":\"\",\"xSeries\":\"\",\"seriesCode\":\"\",\"cab\":\"\",\"bed\":\"\",\"videoCount\":0,\"comment1\":\"Backup Camera,Convertible,Keyless Entry,Lane Departure Warning,Leather Seats,Limited Slip Center Differential,Navigation System,Stability Control,Traction Control\",\"comment2\":\"\",\"comment3\":\"\",\"comment4\":\"\",\"comment5\":\"\",\"otherInfo\":{\"isVinDecodeEnabled\":true},\"dealerComment\":\"\",\"videos\":[],\"images\":{},\"viewCount\":0,\"carfaxReport\":{\"image\":\"https:\\\/\\\/partnerstatic.carfax.com\\\/img\\\/valuebadge\\\/showme.svg\",\"link\":\"https:\\\/\\\/www.carfax.com\\\/vehiclehistory\\\/ar20\\\/O_Nl1MUCzgLKOL8KXwOcbEX06nJmv_B2QaTltheE280OkEqJhoxa08Rhw39xaBhXHWp2lkndXkvOZ_EztAbn7iWMu-PUjGNSFkM\",\"isOneOwner\":false},\"isInTransit\":0,\"certifiedInspectionUrl\":null,\"standardizedExteriorColor\":\"Black\",\"standardizedBody\":\"Unspecified\\\/Other\",\"standardizedDrivetrain\":\"Rear-Wheel Drive\",\"standardizedEngineDisplacement\":\"6.5\",\"standardizedEngineCylinders\":\"Unsp