eater driving excitement to Ferrari's versatile 2+2 convertible. Powered by a 3.9L twin-turbocharged V8 producing 620 horsepower and 561 lb-ft of torque, the Portofino M accelerates from 0&ndash;60 mph in approximately 3.45 seconds while its new 8-speed dual-clutch transmission delivers lightning-fast shifts and exceptional refinement. Its retractable hardtop transforms the Portofino M from an elegant grand tourer into an exhilarating open-air Ferrari, while sculpted bodywork, distinctive front-end styling, and quad exhaust outlets give it a more aggressive presence than its predecessor. Inside, the beautifully appointed cabin combines premium Italian craftsmanship with advanced technology, and Ferrari's five-position Manettino, including Race mode for a more engaging driving experience. Perfect for the enthusiast who wants Ferrari performance without sacrificing long-distance comfort or open-air versatility, the Portofino M offers an exceptional balance of speed, sophistication, and everyday usability. <br\\\/><br\\\/>Contact Prestige Imports to make this Ferrari Portofino M yours today. Sales Price includes dealer fee of $1447.50 and $299 electronic filing fee. Tax, tag, title and registrations fees are not included and are calculated at time of purchase.\\\"\",\"isOEMCertified\":0,\"isDealerCertified\":0,\"body\":\"\",\"standardBody\":null,\"bodyStyle\":\"\",\"epaHighway\":23,\"epaCity\":16,\"drivetrain\":\"Rear Wheel Drive\",\"hasWarranty\":0,\"isSold\":0,\"dealerId\":7006,\"dealerCity\":\"North Miami Beach\",\"dealerState\":\"FL\",\"location\":\"North Miami Beach, FL\",\"dealerName\":\"Lamborghini Miami\",\"seoUrl\":\"vehicle-details\\\/used-2023-ferrari-portofino-m-north-miami-beach-fl-id-65945311\",\"mainImageUrl\":\"\\\/\\\/cdn-ds.com\\\/stock\\\/2023-Ferrari-Portofino-M-North-Miami-Beach-FL\\\/seo\\\/ICC80512-ZFF02RPA5P0293774\\\/sz_106115\\\/8f60a144840d2d2cfcea5a8d68e5df69.jpg\",\"photoCount\":54,\"series\":\"\",\"xSeries\":\"\",\"seriesCode\":\"\",\"cab\