TOFINOM\",\"modelCode\":35525,\"trim\":\"M\",\"styleDescription\":\"\",\"styleId\":427698,\"doorsNumber\":\"2\",\"vin\":\"ZFF02RPA2N0283037\",\"MSRP\":0,\"invoiceAmount\":0,\"blueBook\":0,\"sellingPrice\":274950,\"internetPrice\":0,\"originalPrice\":274950,\"miscPrice1\":0,\"miscPrice2\":0,\"miscPrice3\":0,\"NADARetailPrice\":0,\"mileage\":9190,\"transmission\":\"Automatic\",\"transmissionDescription\":\"\",\"transmissionSpeedNumber\":\"8\",\"engineCylindersNumber\":\"8\",\"engineDisplacement\":\"3.9\",\"engineDescription\":\"3.9L V-8 gasoline direct injection, DOHC, variable valve control, twin turbo, premium unleaded, engine with 612HP\",\"engineAspirationType\":\"\",\"engineBlockType\":\"\",\"interiorColor\":\"Cuoio\",\"interiorColorCode\":\"NAT\",\"interiorColorHex\":null,\"interiorColorIcon\":null,\"upholstery\":\"Leather front seat upholstery\",\"interiorColorGeneric\":null,\"exteriorColor\":\"Rosso Mugello\",\"exteriorColorCode\":\"E32F43\",\"exteriorColorHex\":null,\"exteriorColorIcon\":null,\"exteriorColorGeneric\":null,\"fuelType\":\"\",\"wheelbaseCode\":\"105.1\",\"vehicleId\":147689390,\"isSpecial\":0,\"specialDisclaimer\":\"\",\"daysInStock\":21,\"dateInStock\":{\"date\":\"2026-09-09 00:00:00.000000\",\"timezone_type\":3,\"timezone\":\"UTC\"},\"description\":\"\\\"**2022 Ferrari Portofino M &ndash; Italian Elegance Meets Exhilarating Performance**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Prestige Imports is proud to present this stunning 2022 Ferrari Portofino M, a masterpiece of Italian engineering that seamlessly blends breathtaking performance with open-air luxury. With just 9,190 miles, this meticulously maintained convertible is ready to deliver the ultimate driving experience.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Captivating Design**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Finished in the striking **Rosso Mugello**, this Portofino M commands attention with its iconic Ferrari red exterior that embodies passion and performance. The sophisticated **Cuoio leather interior** creates a warm, luxurious cabin environment that perfectly complements the exterior's bold statement. The premium leather seat trim envelops occupants in Italian craftsmanship, while the 18-way power-adjustable front seats with lumbar support ensure personalized comfort for every journey.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Thrilling Performance**<br\\\/><br\\\/>At the heart of this prancing horse lies a formidable **3.9L twin-turbocharged V8 engine** paired with an 8-speed dual-clutch automatic transmission, delivering explosive acceleration and razor-sharp responsiveness. The rear-wheel-drive configuration, enhanced by an electro-mechanical limited-slip differential and driver-selectable ride control suspension, provides an engaging driving experience whether cruising coastal highways or attacking mountain roads. Ceramic disc brakes ensure confident stopping power worthy of the Ferrari badge.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Convertible Freedom**<br\\\/><br\\\/>The power-retractable hardtop transforms this GT from elegant coupe to exhilarating convertible in seconds, featuring a glass rear window and automatic roll-over protection. Experience the symphony of that twin-turbo V8 with the top down while enjoying the wind in your hair.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Technology & Convenience**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Inside, you'll find a 10.25\\\"\\\" touchscreen infotainment system with integrated navigation, Bluetooth connectivity, and streaming audio. The dual-zone automatic climate control, proximity key entry with push-button start, and comprehensive safety features including front and rear parking sensors and backup camera make every drive effortless.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Peace of Mind**<br\\\/><br\\\/>This Portofino M comes with both **CARFAX and AUTOCHECK clean reports**, ensuring transparency and confidence in your investment.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Stock #AT283037 \\\/ VIN: ZFF02RPA2N0283037**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Don't miss this opportunity to own an exceptional Ferrari Portofino M at Prestige Imports. Contact us today to schedule your exclusive test drive. Sales Price includes dealer fee of $1447.50 and $299 electronic filing fee. Tax, tag, title and registrations fees are not included and are calculated at time of purchase.\\\"\",\"isOEMCertified\":0,\"isDealerCertified\":0,\"body\":\"Convertible\",\"standardBody\":null,\"bodyStyle\":\"Convertible\",\"epaHighway\":23,\"epaCity\":16,\"drivetrain\":\"Rear Wheel Drive\",\"hasWarranty\":0,\"isSold\":0,\"dealerId\":7006,\"dealerCity\":\"North Miami Beach\",\"dealerState\":\"FL\",\"location\":\"North Miami Beach, FL\",\"dealerName\":\"Lamborghini Miami\",\"seoUrl\":\"vehicle-details\\\/used-2022-ferrari-portofino-m-north-miami-beach-fl-id-66119219\",\"mainImageUrl\":\"\\\/\\\/cdn-ds.com\\\/stock\\\/2022-Ferrari-Portofino-M-North-Miami-Beach-FL\\\/seo\\\/ICC80512-ZFF02RPA2N0283037\\\/sz_60537\\\/ec73a8f0191b02e949f7956d7c29b035.jpg\",\"photoCount\":58,\"series\":\"\",\"xSeries\":\"\",\"seriesCode\":\"\",\"cab\":\"\",\"bed\":\"\",\"videoCount\":0,\"comment1\":\"Apple CarPlay,Backup Camera,Convertible,Dual Climate Control,Keyless Entry,Keyless Start,Leather Seats,Limited Slip Center Differential,Navigation System,Power Driver Seat,Rain Sensing Front Wipers,Rear Spoiler,Stability Control,Traction Control,Turbocharged,USB Port\",\"comment2\":\"STDEN\",\"comment3\":\"\",\"comment4\":\"\",\"comment5\":\"\",\"otherInfo\":{\"isVinDecodeEnabled\":true},\"dealerComment\":\"\",\"videos\":[],\"images\":{},\"viewCount\":0,\"carfaxReport\":{\"image\":\"https:\\\/\\\/partnerstatic.carfax.com\\\/img\\\/valuebadge\\\/showme.svg\",\"link\":\"https:\\\/\\\/www.carfax.com\\\/vehiclehistory\\\/ar20\\\/BhU-7_E9l5Vn442uiOfyujjXnbxws1DLYJ3_Y4Wtk81TV3SXayRoKjZwFOcdDr8bFjg_y9Tokf8_nrYdCFr5n30YANlTrrQ0LFI\",\"isOneOwner\":false},\"isInTransit\":0,\"certifiedInspectionUrl\":null,\"standardizedExteriorColor\":\"Red\",\"standardizedBody\":\"Convertible\",\"standardizedDrivetrain\":\"Rear-Wheel Drive\",\"standardizedEngineDisplacement\":\"3.9\",\"standardizedEngineCylinders\":\"8 Cylinder\",\"standardizedTransmission\":\"