\":\"118.8\",\"vehicleId\":146857242,\"isSpecial\":0,\"specialDisclaimer\":\"\",\"daysInStock\":169,\"dateInStock\":{\"date\":\"2026-04-14 00:00:00.000000\",\"timezone_type\":3,\"timezone\":\"UTC\"},\"description\":\"\\\"**2025 Ferrari Purosangue Base &ndash; Where Prancing Horse Heritage Meets Uncompromising Versatility**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Prestige Imports is proud to present this virtually new 2025 Ferrari Purosangue, finished in the legendary **Rosso Corsa** &ndash; the iconic racing red that has defined Ferrari's racing pedigree for generations. With a mere **438 miles** on the odometer, this extraordinary four-door Ferrari represents a rare opportunity to own Maranello's first-ever SUV in essentially pristine condition.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**The Heart of a Champion**<br\\\/><br\\\/>At the core of this masterpiece lies Ferrari's naturally aspirated **6.5-liter V-12 engine** &ndash; a glorious powerplant that delivers an intoxicating symphony of sound and performance. Paired with an **8-speed dual-clutch automatic transmission** with driver-selectable modes and steering wheel-mounted sequential shift controls, the Purosangue delivers power to all four wheels through an advanced automatic full-time all-wheel-drive system with electro-mechanical limited-slip differential.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Technology Meets Luxury**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Step inside to discover a cabin adorned with **semi-aniline leather trim** featuring colored stitching and carbon fiber accents throughout. The **14-way power-adjustable front seats** include **heated functionality** and 4-way lumbar support, ensuring supreme comfort on every journey. The rear passengers enjoy heated bucket seats with power-folding and fore-and-aft adjustment &ndash; a rarity in the supercar world.<br\\\/><br\\\/>Entertainment comes courtesy of the premium **Burmester High-End Audio System** with 21 speakers, featuring **Apple CarPlay** and **Android Auto** connectivity, plus a dedicated 10.2\\\"\\\" passenger screen. The integrated navigation system with voice activation and head-up display keeps you informed without distraction.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Performance Engineering**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Magnetic fluid-filled shock absorbers, active anti-roll bars, and predictive adaptive suspension deliver handling precision worthy of the Ferrari badge. Massive **22\\\"\\\" front and 23\\\"\\\" rear wheels** wear performance tires, while ceramic disc brakes provide stopping power to match the acceleration.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Stock #CD2566 \\\/ VIN: ZSG06VTA1S0316592 \\\/ AUTOCHECK Clean**<br\\\/><br\\\/>This is your chance to own Ferrari's revolutionary Purosangue &ndash; practical enough for daily life, thrilling enough to bear the Prancing Horse. All pricing and details provided are believed to be accurate, but we do not warrant or guarantee such accuracy. The prices shown above may vary from region to region, as will incentives, and are subject to change. New vehicles offered may be eligible for manufacturer incentives which may change at any time and are subject to incentive qualification criteria and requirements, and which may be contingent upon manufacturer finance company approval. Manufacturer incentive data and vehicle features information is provided by third parties and believed to be accurate as of the time of publication. Vehicle information is based upon standard equipment and may vary from vehicle to vehicle. Please contact the dealership.\\\"\",\"isOEMCertified\":0,\"isDealerCertified\":0,\"body\":\"Sport Utility\",\"standardBody\":null,\"bodyStyle\":\"Sport Utility\",\"epaHighway\":15,\"epaCity\":11,\"drivetrain\":\"All Wheel Drive\",\"hasWarranty\":0,\"isSold\":0,\"dealerId\":7006,\"dealerCity\":\"North Miami Beach\",\"dealerState\":\"FL\",\"location\":\"North Miami Beach, FL\",\"dealerName\":\"Lamborghini Miami\",\"seoUrl\":\"vehicle-details\\\/used-2025-ferrari-purosangue---north-miami-beach-fl-id-64688969\",\"mainImageUrl\":\"\\\/\\\/cdn-ds.com\\\/stock\\\/2025-Ferrari-Purosangue---North-