ophisticated 4RM-S all-wheel-drive system. The Purosangue can accelerate from 0&ndash;62 mph in just 3.3 seconds and reach a top speed exceeding 192 mph, delivering breathtaking performance from a vehicle designed to comfortably accommodate four adults. Its dramatic proportions, rear-hinged rear doors, sculpted aerodynamic bodywork, and unmistakable Ferrari design language give it a presence unlike anything else on the road, while its advanced active suspension and four-wheel steering provide remarkable control and agility. Inside, the meticulously crafted cabin surrounds all four occupants with premium Italian materials, sophisticated technology, and an intimate, driver-focused atmosphere, proving that practicality and Ferrari's performance heritage can coexist beautifully. With its naturally aspirated V12, innovative chassis technology, and four-seat configuration, the Purosangue represents an entirely new chapter in Ferrari's history. <br\\\/><br\\\/>Contact Prestige Imports to make this Ferrari Purosangue yours today. Sales Price includes dealer fee of $1447.50 and $299 electronic filing fee. Tax, tag, title and registrations fees are not included and are calculated at time of purchase.\",\"isOEMCertified\":0,\"isDealerCertified\":0,\"body\":\"\",\"standardBody\":null,\"bodyStyle\":\"\",\"epaHighway\":15,\"epaCity\":11,\"drivetrain\":\"All Wheel Drive\",\"hasWarranty\":0,\"isSold\":0,\"dealerId\":7006,\"dealerCity\":\"North Miami Beach\",\"dealerState\":\"FL\",\"location\":\"North Miami Beach, FL\",\"dealerName\":\"Lamborghini Miami\",\"seoUrl\":\"vehicle-details\\\/used-2025-ferrari-purosangue---north-miami-beach-fl-id-65810523\",\"mainImageUrl\":\"\\\/\\\/cdn-ds.com\\\/stock\\\/2025-Ferrari-Purosangue---North-Miami-Beach-FL\\\/seo\\\/ICC80512-ZSG06VTA0S0317104\\\/sz_112033\\\/3c76b51e6106e056b5a98d183e17b7c1.jpg\",\"photoCount\":60,\"series\":\"\",\"xSeries\":\"\",\"seriesCode\":\"\",\"cab\":\"\",\"bed\":\"\",\"videoCount\":0,\"comment1\":\"Adaptive Cruise Con