 an unmistakable presence that blends Ferrari's exotic design language with the practicality of a four-door grand tourer. Inside, the cabin showcases exquisite Italian craftsmanship, premium materials, advanced technology, and four individual seats designed to provide an exceptional experience for both driver and passengers. With its naturally aspirated V12, four-door configuration, and supercar-level performance, the Purosangue represents a completely new expression of Ferrari's legendary engineering and unmistakable character. <br\\\/><br\\\/>Contact Prestige Imports to make this Ferrari Purosangue yours today. Sales Price includes dealer fee of $1447.50 and $299 electronic filing fee. Tax, tag, title and registrations fees are not included and are calculated at time of purchase.\",\"isOEMCertified\":0,\"isDealerCertified\":0,\"body\":\"Utility\",\"standardBody\":null,\"bodyStyle\":\"Utility\",\"epaHighway\":15,\"epaCity\":11,\"drivetrain\":\"All Wheel Drive\",\"hasWarranty\":0,\"isSold\":0,\"dealerId\":7006,\"dealerCity\":\"North Miami Beach\",\"dealerState\":\"FL\",\"location\":\"North Miami Beach, FL\",\"dealerName\":\"Lamborghini Miami\",\"seoUrl\":\"vehicle-details\\\/used-2024-ferrari-purosangue---north-miami-beach-fl-id-66024049\",\"mainImageUrl\":\"\\\/\\\/cdn-ds.com\\\/stock\\\/2024-Ferrari-Purosangue---North-Miami-Beach-FL\\\/seo\\\/ICC80512-ZSG06VTA0R0304086\\\/sz_111295\\\/34467d457589c4473476e97cb159b43e.jpg\",\"photoCount\":50,\"series\":\"\",\"xSeries\":\"\",\"seriesCode\":\"\",\"cab\":\"\",\"bed\":\"\",\"videoCount\":0,\"comment1\":\"Adaptive Cruise Control,All Wheel Drive,Android Auto,Apple CarPlay,Automatic Emergency Braking,Backup Camera,Blind Spot Monitor,Brake Assist,Dual Climate Control,Head-Up Display,Heated Seats,Hybrid,Keyless Entry,Lane Departure Warning,Leather Seats,Limited Slip Center Differential,Memory Seat,Navigation System,Power Driver Seat,Rain Sensing Front Wipers,Rear Air Conditioning Controls,Rear Spoiler,Stability Control,Trac