mium materials, advanced digital displays, and Koenigsegg's unique SmartWheel technology, blending cutting-edge engineering with meticulous craftsmanship. With its extraordinary power, lightweight construction, extreme aerodynamic capability, and incredibly limited production, the Jesko Attack represents one of the most exclusive and technically advanced hypercars ever created. <br\\\/><br\\\/>Contact Prestige Imports to make this Koenigsegg Jesko Attack yours today. Sales Price includes dealer fee of $1447.50 and $299 electronic filing fee. Tax, tag, title and registrations fees are not included and are calculated at time of purchase.\",\"isOEMCertified\":0,\"isDealerCertified\":0,\"body\":\"\",\"standardBody\":null,\"bodyStyle\":\"\",\"epaHighway\":null,\"epaCity\":null,\"drivetrain\":\"Rear Wheel Drive\",\"hasWarranty\":0,\"isSold\":0,\"dealerId\":7006,\"dealerCity\":\"North Miami Beach\",\"dealerState\":\"FL\",\"location\":\"North Miami Beach, FL\",\"dealerName\":\"Lamborghini Miami\",\"seoUrl\":\"vehicle-details\\\/used-2025-koenigsegg-jesko-attack-north-miami-beach-fl-id-66080939\",\"mainImageUrl\":\"\\\/\\\/cdn-ds.com\\\/stock\\\/2025-Koenigsegg-Jesko-Attack-North-Miami-Beach-FL\\\/seo\\\/ICC80512-YT9PR1U11SA007325\\\/sz_115525\\\/707dce63213a36449b85acdf760f0ef2.jpg\",\"photoCount\":60,\"series\":\"\",\"xSeries\":\"\",\"seriesCode\":\"\",\"cab\":\"\",\"bed\":\"\",\"videoCount\":0,\"comment1\":\"Turbocharged\",\"comment2\":\"\",\"comment3\":\"\",\"comment4\":\"\",\"comment5\":\"\",\"otherInfo\":{\"isVinDecodeEnabled\":true},\"dealerComment\":\"\",\"videos\":[],\"images\":{},\"viewCount\":0,\"carfaxReport\":{\"image\":\"https:\\\/\\\/partnerstatic.carfax.com\\\/img\\\/valuebadge\\\/showme.svg\",\"link\":\"https:\\\/\\\/www.carfax.com\\\/vehiclehistory\\\/ar20\\\/-ByMvTeQeisP-haBUNq_Pm41NmBETHPxat4TVNQzwJ6vFVPMGNDAzRCmkmfD58N8Md7XjcC4UfcMDEB8IfD2abR_DTJup83ElE0\",\"isOneOwner\":false},\"isInTransit\":0,\"certifiedInspectionUrl\":null,\"standardizedExteriorColor