ed dual-clutch transmission featuring sequential shift control and steering wheel-mounted paddles, every gear change is lightning-fast and precise. The full-time all-wheel-drive system ensures maximum traction and control, while the sport-tuned suspension with double wishbone configuration delivers razor-sharp handling dynamics.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Exquisite Interior Craftsmanship**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Step inside to discover the stunning Nero Cosmus interior, featuring premium Unicolor Alcantara seat trim that envelops you in luxury. The full Alcantara simulated suede headliner and carbon fiber accents throughout the cabin create an atmosphere of pure sophistication. Sport bucket seats with electric adjustments provide optimal support during spirited driving, while the dual-zone automatic climate control ensures comfort in any condition.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Track-Ready Technology**<br\\\/><br\\\/>This Huracan comes equipped with driver-selectable modes, allowing you to tailor the driving experience to your preference. The 4-wheel disc brakes with ceramic rotors provide fade-resistant stopping power, while the mechanical limited slip differential maximizes cornering capability. Forged 20-inch Mimas Silver wheels with a distinctive 5-spoke design complete the aggressive stance.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Peace of Mind**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Both CARFAX and AUTOCHECK reports confirm this Huracan's clean history, giving you complete confidence in your investment.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Visit Prestige Imports Today**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Stock #ATA10746 \\\/ VIN: ZHWUS4ZF6JLA10746<br\\\/><br\\\/>Don't miss this rare opportunity to own an icon of automotive excellence. Contact Prestige Imports today to schedule your exclusive test drive and experience the Lamborghini difference. Sales Price includes dealer fee of $1447.50 and $299 electronic filing fee. Tax, tag, title and registrations fees are not included and are calculated at time of purchase.\",\"isOEMCertified\":0,\"isDealerCertified\":0,\"body\":\"\",\