omplemented by dual front and single rear electric motors, creating a revolutionary plug-in hybrid powertrain that redefines what's possible in a supercar. The sophisticated 8-speed dual-clutch automatic transmission with driver-selectable modes and sequential shift control delivers lightning-fast gear changes, while the full-time all-wheel-drive system ensures maximum traction and control. The advanced regenerative braking system with ceramic discs provides fade-free stopping power worthy of this machine's capabilities.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Cutting-Edge Technology**<br\\\/><br\\\/>The Revuelto features an 8.4-inch vertical touchscreen with Amazon Alexa integration, **Apple CarPlay**, and **Android Auto** compatibility, seamlessly blending supercar performance with modern connectivity. The over-the-air navigation updates ensure you're always equipped with the latest mapping technology. Dual LCD monitors keep vital information at your fingertips, while the wireless phone connectivity and mobile hotspot keep you connected on every journey.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Exquisite Craftsmanship**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Step inside to discover **premium leather seat trim** with meticulous contrast stitching, carbon fiber instrument panel inserts, and Corsa-Tex leather\\\/simulated suede accents throughout. The comfort-focused seats provide exceptional support during spirited driving, while the dual-zone automatic climate control ensures perfect cabin conditions.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Advanced Engineering**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Magnetic fluid-filled shock absorbers and adaptive suspension with driver-selectable ride control deliver exceptional handling dynamics. The 20-inch front and 21-inch rear Venancio shiny silver wheels wrapped in performance run-flat tires complete the aggressive stance.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Stock #ATA00252 \\\/ VIN: ZHWUC1ZM0RLA00252**<br\\\/><br\\\/>This is your opportunity to own automotive history. Contact Prestige Imports today to experience the Revuelto's breathtaking performance firsthand. Sales Price includes dealer fee of $1447.50 and $299 electronic filing fee. Tax, tag, title and registrations fees are not included and are calculated at time of purchase.\",\"isOEMCertified\":0,\"isDealerCertified\":0,\"body\":\"\",\"standardBody\":null,\"bodyStyle\":\"\",\"epaHighway\":17,\"epaCity\":10,\"drivetrain\":\"All Wheel Drive\",\"hasWarranty\":0,\"isSold\":0,\"dealerId\":7006,\"dealerCity\":\"North Miami Beach\",\"dealerState\":\"FL\",\"location\":\"North Miami Beach, FL\",\"dealerName\":\"Lamborghini Miami\",\"seoUrl\":\"vehicle-details\\\/used-2024-lamborghini-revuelto---north-miami-beach-fl-id-65607471\",\"mainImageUrl\":\"\\\/\\\/cdn-ds.com\\\/stock\\\/2024-Lamborghini-Revuelto---North-Miami-Beach-FL\\\/seo\\\/ICC80512-ZHWUC1ZM0RLA00252\\\/sz_106649\\\/f79d58b10ca2fefdad91947dc3220d4e.jpg\",\"photoCount\":58,\"series\":\"\",\"xSeries\":\"\",\"seriesCode\":\"\",\"cab\":\"\",\"bed\":\"\",\"videoCount\":0,\"comment1\":\"Android Auto,Apple CarPlay,Backup Camera,Hybrid,Keyless Entry,Keyless Start,Lane Departure Warning,Leather Seats,Limited Slip Center Differential,Navigation System,Rear Spoiler,Stability Control,Traction Control\",\"comment2\":\"\",\"comment3\":\"\",\"comment4\":\"\",\"comment5\":\"\",\"otherInfo\":{\"isVinDecodeEnabled\":true},\"dealerComment\":\"\",\"videos\":[],\"images\":{},\"viewCount\":0,\"carfaxReport\":{\"image\":\"https:\\\/\\\/partnerstatic.carfax.com\\\/img\\\/valuebadge\\\/1own.svg\",\"link\":\"https:\\\/\\\/www.carfax.com\\\/vehiclehistory\\\/ar20\\\/oeqQ7YdSRO3LykETWBDPBmYuF-5AL78ExYroKuiFOYBczUaMo_160Q8nYLLlj3I8x5-iO6VqcXMKYKEWtFSiiIvjCvPP94i7_Po\",\"isOneOwner\":true},\"isInTransit\":0,\"certifiedInspectionUrl\":null,\"standardizedExteriorColor\":\"Gray\",\"standardizedBody\":\"Unspecified\\\/Other\",\"standardizedDrivetrain\":\"All-Wheel Drive\",\"standardizedEngineDisplacement\":\"6.5\",\"standardizedEngineCylinders\":\"Unspecified\\\/Other\",\"standardizedTransmission\":\"Automatic\",\"standardizedFuelType\":\