HC 48V engine paired with dual front and single rear electric motors, delivering an intoxicating blend of raw power and cutting-edge efficiency through an 8-speed dual-clutch automatic transmission. The full-time all-wheel-drive system with electro-mechanical limited slip differential ensures every ounce of power reaches the pavement with precision. The 3.8 kWh lithium-ion traction battery enables regenerative braking and electric-only driving capabilities, making this the most advanced Lamborghini ever created.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Track-Ready Engineering**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Experience uncompromising control with magnetic fluid-filled shock absorbers, adaptive sport-tuned suspension with driver-selectable ride height, and ceramic disc brakes with 4-wheel ABS. The double wishbone suspension front and rear, combined with front and rear anti-roll bars, delivers razor-sharp handling worthy of the Raging Bull badge.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Stunning Design & Technology**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Rolling on exclusive 20-inch front and 21-inch rear Venancio Shiny Silver wheels wrapped in performance run-flat summer tires, this Revuelto commands attention from every angle. The power spoiler, composite\\\/aluminum panels, and aggressive aerodynamics showcase pure Italian artistry.<br\\\/><br\\\/>Inside, luxurious leather seat trim envelops you in comfort, while the 8.4-inch infotainment touchscreen features **Apple CarPlay** and **Android Auto** integration, navigation, and wireless connectivity. The driver-focused cockpit includes carbon fiber instrument panel inserts, simulated suede accents, and a sport leather steering wheel with sequential shift controls.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Safety & Convenience**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Advanced safety features include active lane departure warning, backup camera, dual-stage airbags throughout, electronic stability control, and emergency SOS capability. Proximity key entry with push-button start, dual-zone automatic climate control, and power-folding heated mirrors add everyday usability to this exotic machine.<br\\\/><br\\\/>This is your opportunity to own automotive history. Contact Prestige Imports today to experience the 2025 Lamborghini Revuelto. Sales Price includes dealer fee of $1447.50 and $299 electronic filing fee. Tax, tag, title and registrations fees are not included and are calculated at time of purchase.\",\"isOEMCertified\":0,\"isDealerCertified\":0,\"body\":\"\",\"standardBody\":null,\"bodyStyle\":\"\",\"epaHighway\":17,\"epaCity\":10,\"drivetrain\":\"All Wheel Drive\",\"hasWarranty\":0,\"isSold\":0,\"dealerId\":7006,\"dealerCity\":\"North Miami Beach\",\"dealerState\":\"FL\",\"location\":\"North Miami Beach, FL\",\"dealerName\":\"Lamborghini Miami\",\"seoUrl\":\"vehicle-details\\\/used-2025-lamborghini-revuelto---north-miami-beach-fl-id-66046886\",\"mainImageUrl\":null,\"photoCount\":0,\"series\":\"\",\"xSeries\":\"\",\"seriesCode\":\"\",\"cab\":\"\",\"bed\":\"\",\"videoCount\":0,\"comment1\":\"Android Auto,Apple CarPlay,Backup Camera,Hybrid,Keyless Entry,Keyless Start,Lane Departure Warning,Leather Seats,Limited Slip Center Differential,Navigation System,Rear Spoiler,Stability Control,Traction Control\",\"comment2\":\"\",\"comment3\":\"\",\"comment4\":\"\",\"comment5\":\"\",\"otherInfo\":{\"isVinDecodeEnabled\":true},\"dealerComment\":\"\",\"videos\":[],\"images\":{},\"viewCount\":0,\"carfaxReport\":{\"image\":\"https:\\\/\\\/partnerstatic.carfax.com\\\/img\\\/valuebadge\\\/1own.svg\",\"link\":\"https:\\\/\\\/www.carfax.com\\\/vehiclehistory\\\/ar20\\\/feARtimyunWvsECcc_R_kvfOD-_cedeNFblew4ol30SmBu84Gu048PwryfolT2Zz7V732_1q9wIdbBOafD-ijxuc9VHucbyOM4w\",\"isOneOwner\":true},\"isInTransit\":0,\"certifiedInspectionUrl\":null,\"standardizedExteriorColor\":\"Unspecified\\\/Other\",\"standardizedBody\":\"Unspecified\\\/Other\",\"standardizedDrivetrain\":\"All-Wheel Drive\",\"standardizedEngineDisplacement\":\"6.5\",\"standardizedEngineCylinders\":\"Unspecified\\\/Other\",\"standardizedTransmission\":\"Automatic\",\"st