 limited-slip differential, ensures devastating performance in any driving mode. The 3.8 kWh lithium-ion traction battery provides instant electric torque while enabling regenerative braking capabilities.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**DYNAMIC SUPERIORITY**<br\\\/><br\\\/>This Revuelto features magnetic fluid-filled shock absorbers with driver-controlled adaptive suspension, offering multiple ride heights and sport-tuned settings. The double-wishbone suspension front and rear, combined with ceramic disc brakes and front\\\/rear anti-roll bars, delivers razor-sharp handling worthy of the Raging Bull badge. Stunning 20-inch front and 21-inch rear Venancio Shiny Silver wheels wrapped in performance run-flat summer tires complete the aggressive stance.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**TECHNOLOGY & LUXURY**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Inside, the driver-focused cockpit features an 8.4-inch infotainment touchscreen with **Apple CarPlay** and **Android Auto** integration, navigation with real-time traffic, and wireless connectivity. Premium **leather seat trim** with contrast stitching envelops the comfort seats, while carbon fiber and aluminum accents create an unmistakably exotic atmosphere. Dual-zone automatic climate control, power windows, and a comprehensive driver information center ensure modern convenience meets Italian passion.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**VERIFIED QUALITY**<br\\\/><br\\\/>This Revuelto comes with an **AUTOCHECK Clean** report, providing complete peace of mind.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Stock #ATA03103 \\\/ VIN: ZHWUC1ZM1SLA03103**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Don't miss this rare opportunity to own Lamborghini's groundbreaking hybrid flagship. Contact Prestige Imports today to experience automotive history in the making. Sales Price includes dealer fee of $1447.50 and $299 electronic filing fee. Tax, tag, title and registrations fees are not included and are calculated at time of purchase.\",\"isOEMCertified\":0,\"isDealerCertified\":0,\"body\":\"\",\"standardBody\":null,\"bodyStyle\":\"\",\"epaHighway\":17,\"epaCity\":10