0 mph. Its sophisticated all-wheel-drive system, electronically controlled chassis, rear-wheel steering, and advanced hybrid technology provide exceptional traction, agility, and control while allowing the Temerario's high-revving V8 to reach an incredible 10,000 rpm. The dramatic exterior features sharp Lamborghini styling, sculpted bodywork, distinctive LED lighting, aggressive aerodynamic elements, and exotic proportions that make its performance intentions immediately clear. Inside, the cockpit combines premium Italian craftsmanship with advanced digital displays, performance-focused controls, and a driver-centric layout designed to keep the driver connected to the car. As the successor to the Hurac&aacute;n, the Temerario introduces Lamborghini's next generation of electrified supercar performance while retaining the emotional character and unmistakable design that define the marque. <br\\\/><br\\\/>Contact Prestige Imports \\\/ Lamborghini Miami to make this Temerario yours today. Sales Price includes dealer fee of $1447.50 and $299 electronic filing fee. Tax, tag, title and registrations fees are not included and are calculated at time of purchase.\",\"isOEMCertified\":0,\"isDealerCertified\":0,\"body\":\"\",\"standardBody\":null,\"bodyStyle\":\"\",\"epaHighway\":19,\"epaCity\":14,\"drivetrain\":\"All Wheel Drive\",\"hasWarranty\":0,\"isSold\":0,\"dealerId\":7006,\"dealerCity\":\"North Miami Beach\",\"dealerState\":\"FL\",\"location\":\"North Miami Beach, FL\",\"dealerName\":\"Lamborghini Miami\",\"seoUrl\":\"vehicle-details\\\/new-2026-lamborghini-temerario---north-miami-beach-fl-id-66311290\",\"mainImageUrl\":\"\\\/\\\/cdn-ds.com\\\/stock\\\/2026-Lamborghini-Temerario---North-Miami-Beach-FL\\\/seo\\\/ICC80512-ZHWUC1ZC1TLA02400\\\/sz_1\\\/3cdec9d1a04920620bdb81dc3299b9d6.jpg\",\"photoCount\":41,\"series\":\"\",\"xSeries\":\"\",\"seriesCode\":\"\",\"cab\":\"\",\"bed\":\"\",\"videoCount\":0,\"comment1\":\"Backup Camera,Hybrid,Keyless Entry,Keyless Start,Lane D